285
00:10:33,231 --> 00:10:34,513
eight nine cents.

286
00:10:34,693 --> 00:10:37,542
In Hawaii, the same fill-up would be,

287
00:10:37,542 --> 00:10:38,928
by our arithmetic,

288
00:10:38,928 --> 00:10:42,623
about forty-nine dollars and thirty-three cents.

289
00:10:42,803 --> 00:10:46,563
In Nebraska, about thirteen dollars and seven

290
00:10:46,563 --> 00:10:47,064
cents.

291
00:10:47,414 --> 00:10:48,900
How far does a charge go?

292
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:53,121
Wikipedia gives four hundred ninety kilometres on

293
00:10:53,121 --> 00:10:54,522
the W L T P test,

294
00:10:54,522 --> 00:10:57,079
about three hundred four miles.

295
00:10:57,259 --> 00:11:00,719
Dividing twenty dollars forty-one by three hundred

296
00:11:00,719 --> 00:11:03,349
