00:11:11,773 --> 00:11:15,444
One thousand, three hundred seventy-one miles at

304
00:11:15,444 --> 00:11:18,580
six point seven cents is about ninety-two

305
00:11:18,580 --> 00:11:19,191
dollars.

306
00:11:19,371 --> 00:11:21,907
That is the electricity for the whole

307
00:11:21,907 --> 00:11:23,003
