319
00:11:45,803 --> 00:11:47,783
But even if the cost were ten

320
00:11:47,783 --> 00:11:50,037
times higher, it would still be a

321
00:11:50,037 --> 00:11:51,608
tiny part of the total.

322
00:11:51,788 --> 00:11:54,203
That is the real surprise.

323
00:11:54,553 --> 00:11:57,037
Charging time is a different cost.

324
00:11:57,217 --> 00:12:00,270
Wikipedia says the Nevera can fast-charge to

325
00:12:00,270 --> 00:12:02,976
