328
00:12:08,119 --> 00:12:10,439
Ninety-six in half an hour means an

329
00:12:10,439 --> 00:12:12,892
average of at least about one hundred

330
00:12:12,892 --> 00:12:14,284
ninety-two kilowatts.

331
00:12:14,464 --> 00:12:17,041
That needs a serious public charger,

332
00:12:17,041 --> 00:12:18,330
