337
00:12:27,913 --> 00:12:30,928
the electricity would be about six hundred

338
00:12:30,928 --> 00:12:33,442
seventy dollars, by our arithmetic.

339
00:12:33,622 --> 00:12:35,617
Even a full decade of that would

340
00:12:35,617 --> 00:12:37,987
