341
00:12:38,167 --> 00:12:40,449
Against a seven-figure gap,

342
00:12:40,449 --> 00:12:42,393
it is almost invisible.

343
00:12:42,743 --> 00:12:44,552
Compare that with the price of a

344
00:12:44,552 --> 00:12:45,343
