345
00:12:45,523 --> 00:12:47,341
The carbon package alone,

346
00:12:47,341 --> 00:12:51,122
eighty-six thousand, five hundred fifty-six dollars,

347
00:12:51,122 --> 00:12:53,812
would pay for the electricity of more

348
00:12:53,812 --> 00:12:56,648
than a hundred twenty-five years at ten

349
00:12:56,648 --> 00:12:58,248
thousand miles a year.

350
00:12:58,428 --> 00:13:00,737
That is a strange sentence to write

351
00:13:00,737 --> 00:13:01,529
about a car,

352
00:13:01,529 --> 00:13:03,838
but it is what the arithmetic says.

353
00:13:04,188 --> 00:13:06,887
The biggest unknown in any electric car

354
00:13:06,887 --> 00:13:07,926
