357
00:13:14,660 --> 00:13:17,231
weighs seven hundred kilograms.

358
00:13:17,411 --> 00:13:20,688
If it ever needed replacing outside warranty,

359
00:13:20,688 --> 00:13:22,508
that is a lot of battery.

360
00:13:22,688 --> 00:13:25,533
And nobody has published a replacement price

361
00:13:25,533 --> 00:13:26,438
we could find.

362
00:13:26,789 --> 00:13:28,254
Rimac knows this fear,

363
00:13:28,254 --> 00:13:29,587
