372
00:13:52,053 --> 00:13:54,119
That is a claim from the company,

373
00:13:54,119 --> 00:13:55,997
and we have not seen it tested

374
00:13:55,997 --> 00:13:56,999
over many years.

375
00:13:57,179 --> 00:13:59,451
But it shows that Rimac is selling

376
00:13:59,451 --> 00:14:01,456
the Nevera on the idea that an

377
00:14:01,456 --> 00:14:04,330
electric hypercar has fewer parts that wear

378
00:14:04,330 --> 00:14:04,598
out.

379
00:14:04,948 --> 00:14:07,757
Here is the arithmetic of that warranty.

380
00:14:07,937 --> 00:14:10,867
If the eight years count from delivery,

381
00:14:10,867 --> 00:14:13,721
as we would expect but cannot confirm,

382
00:14:13,721 --> 00:14:16,500
this car's coverage would run to June

383
00:14:16,500 --> 00:14:17,852
twenty thirty-one.

384
00:14:18,032 --> 00:14:20,215
For a car with fewer than fifteen

385
00:14:20,215 --> 00:14:23,059
hundred miles, the mileage will not matter.

386
00:14:23,239 --> 00:14:25,817
The real test will be the years.

387
00:14:25,997 --> 00:14:30,203
Seventy-five percent of a hundred twenty kilowatt-hours

388
00:14:30,203 --> 00:14:32,115
is ninety kilowatt-hours.

389
00:14:32,465 --> 00:14:34,479
It is worth saying what a warranty

390
00:14:34,479 --> 00:14:35,367
cannot protect.

391
00:14:35,547 --> 00:14:38,055
It does not protect the resale price.

392
00:14:38,235 --> 00:14:40,543
A battery can be perfectly healthy,

393
00:14:40,543 --> 00:14:42,719
as this one almost certainly was,

394
00:14:42,719 --> 00:14:44,763
and the car can still be valued

395
00:14:44,763 --> 00:14:46,675
at half of its sticker price.

396
00:14:46,855 --> 00:14:48,957
Warranty covers failures,

397
00:14:48,957 --> 00:14:51,395
not fashions or market moods.

398
00:14:51,745 --> 00:14:53,904
So what costs did we not find?

399
00:14:54,084 --> 00:14:56,023
Insurance for a Nevera.

400
00:14:56,203 --> 00:14:58,525
A price for a set of tyres.

401
00:14:58,705 --> 00:15:00,841
A replacement price for a battery.

402
00:15:01,021 --> 00:15:02,972
The cost of a service visit.

403
00:15:03,152 --> 00:15:05,241
None of the sources we read gave

404
00:15:05,241 --> 00:15:07,331
a figure, and we will not guess.

405
00:15:07,511 --> 00:15:08,504
If you own one,

406
00:15:08,504 --> 00:15:10,821
those are the numbers we would love

407
00:15:10,821 --> 00:15:11,284
to see.

408
00:15:11,635 --> 00:15:13,287
We do know what the car is

409
00:15:13,287 --> 00:15:14,049
fitted with.

410
00:15:14,229 --> 00:15:18,027
Autoevolution says the tyres are Michelin Pilot

411
00:15:18,027 --> 00:15:19,077
Sport four S,

412
00:15:19,077 --> 00:15:21,662
