413
00:15:21,662 --> 00:15:25,459
lift system, active aero elements and butterfly

414
00:15:25,459 --> 00:15:25,944
doors.

415
00:15:26,124 --> 00:15:28,463
Every one of those features is a

416
00:15:28,463 --> 00:15:29,559
thing that can,

417
00:15:29,559 --> 00:15:31,314
in principle, need care.

418
00:15:31,494 --> 00:15:33,495
But we have no cost to attach

419
00:15:33,495 --> 00:15:34,048
to them.

420
00:15:34,398 --> 00:15:37,305
Autoblog also says the car has carbon

421
00:15:37,305 --> 00:15:40,448
ceramic brakes with six-piston calipers,

422
00:15:40,448 --> 00:15:41,863
electro-hydraulic.

423
00:15:42,043 --> 00:15:44,825
Carbon ceramic brakes are known for being

424
00:15:44,825 --> 00:15:46,249
expensive on any car,

425
00:15:46,249 --> 00:15:48,353
but we did not find a published

426
00:15:48,353 --> 00:15:49,438
price for these.

427
00:15:49,618 --> 00:15:52,678
Honest answer: the running cost of a

428
00:15:52,678 --> 00:15:55,312
Nevera is mostly a blank on the

429
00:15:55,312 --> 00:15:55,737
page.

430
00:15:56,087 --> 00:15:58,443
One auction is one data point.

431
00:15:58,623 --> 00:15:59,854
So we looked for more.

432
00:16:00,034 --> 00:16:01,281
The Classic Valuer,

433
00:16:01,281 --> 00:16:02,200
a price guide,

434
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:04,824
lists three Neveras that went to auction

435
00:16:04,824 --> 00:16:06,071
on Bring a Trailer.

436
00:16:06,251 --> 00:16:08,761
One was the twenty twenty-three car we

437
00:16:08,761 --> 00:16:10,149
have been discussing,

438
00:16:10,149 --> 00:16:11,998
in April twenty twenty-five.

439
00:16:12,178 --> 00:16:13,478
It did not sell.

440
00:16:13,829 --> 00:16:16,859
A twenty twenty-four Nevera also failed to

441
00:16:16,859 --> 00:16:19,673
sell, on the thirteenth of April twenty

442
00:16:19,673 --> 00:16:22,559
twenty-six, according to the same guide.

443
00:16:22,739 --> 00:16:26,097
And a twenty twenty-three Nevera Time Attack

444
00:16:26,097 --> 00:16:28,616
car sold on the fifteenth of June

445
00:16:28,616 --> 00:16:31,287
twenty twenty-six, for one million,

446
00:16:31,287 --> 00:16:33,653
two hundred fifty-one thousand,

447
00:16:33,653 --> 00:16:36,172
five hundred eighty-three pounds.

448
00:16:36,522 --> 00:16:38,972
The guide gives a sell-through rate of

449
00:16:38,972 --> 00:16:41,938
thirty-three percent, because one of its three

450
00:16:41,938 --> 00:16:43,035
